jersey and a thin silver ring worn on a cord. William has a narrow face with an expressive upper lip, with a swept fringe and a closely clipped nape. William presses the lips together to keep a smile in during a conversation.","personality":"William treats keeping somebody waiting as a serious discourtesy. This can turn a helpful person into an impatient one when everybody else needs a slower conversation.","agenda":"To publish a match score the passengers can see.","family":"Cora Adair is William’s half-sibling. William keeps the photographs. Cora knows which ones can be shared. They enjoy remembering people in public and also know what it feels like to have a private afternoon turned into an anecdote for strangers. Asked about *The missing Sunday*, Cora says, “I arranged every important task. My father asked what hour I'd set aside to waste with him.”","connections":"Aisha Ortiz. The passenger who recognized a teacher starts looking out for the match score.","familyIds":["AH-R1332"],"connectionIds":["AH-R0711"],"reactions":[{"situation":"A passenger asks to photograph a stranger through the kitchen window","response":"William waits for the resident to give permission before a camera goes up.","asWritten":"A passenger asks to photograph a stranger through the kitchen window. William waits for the resident to give permission before a camera goes up."},{"situation":"A stranger offers money to cut ahead of an exhausted neighbor","response":"William asks the neighbor privately what they want, without treating their place as something for sale.","asWritten":"A stranger offers money to cut ahead of an exhausted neighbor. William asks the neighbor privately what they want, without treating their place as something for sale."},{"situation":"If a frightened person needs longer","response":"William changes the plan openly and takes responsibility for the delay.","asWritten":"If a frightened person needs longer, William changes the plan openly and takes responsibility for the delay."}]},"appearanceSource":"biography casting design"}},{"mesh":6,"name":"Hair_bob02","skin":0},{"mesh":7,"name":"Cloth_tshirt","skin":0},{"mesh":8,"name":"Cloth_jeans","skin":0},{"mesh":9,"name":"Cloth_boots","skin":0}],"meshes":[{"name":"base","extras":{"targetNames":["gender_male","age_old","weight_max","muscle_max","height_short","face_nose_width_incr","face_nose_length_decr","face_nose_height_incr","face_jaw_width_incr","face_chin_incr","face_cheekbones_decr","face_eye_size_decr","face_eye_spacing_incr","face_eye_tilt_decr","face_lips_decr","face_mouth_width_incr","face_ear_size_incr","face_forehead_decr","blink_left","blink_right","corr_gender_male__age_old","corr_weight_max__muscle_max","corr_gender_male__muscle_max","corr_gender_male__weight_max"]},"weights":[0.4742,0.5,0.3422,0.058,0.388,0.5283,0.1945,0.1926,0.1076,0.1149,0.1177,0.1825,0.1198,0.2782,0.1242,0.2338,0.3021,0.3738,0,0,0.2371,0.01985,0.0275,0.16227],"primitives":[{"attributes":{"POSITION":2,"NORMAL":3,"TEXCOORD_0":4,"JOINTS_0":5,"WEIGHTS_0":6},"indices":1,"material":0,"targets":[{"POSITION":7,"NORMAL":8},{"POSITION":9,"NORMAL":10},{"POSITION":11,"NORMAL":12},{"POSITION":13,"NORMAL":14},{"POSITION":15,"NORMAL":16},{"POSITION":17,"NORMAL":18},{"POSITION":19,"NORMAL":20},{"POSITION":21,"NORMAL":22},{"POSITION":23,"NORMAL":24},{"POSITION":25,"NORMAL":26},{"POSITION":27,"NORMAL":28},{"POSITION":29,"NORMAL":30},{"POSITION":31,"NORMAL":32},{"POSITION":33,"NORMAL":34},{"POSITION":35,"NORMAL":36},{"POSITION":37,"NORMAL":38},{"POSITION":39,"NORMAL":40},{"POSITION":41,"NORMAL":42},{"POSITION":43,"NORMAL":44},{"POSITION":45,"NORMAL":46},{"POSITION":47,"NORMAL":48},{"POSITION":49,"NORMAL":50},{"POSITION":51,"NORMAL":52},{"POSITION":53,"NORMAL":54}]}]},{"name":"Eyebrows","extras":{"targetNames":["gender_male","age_old","weight_max","muscle_max","height_short","face_nose_width_incr","face_nose_length_decr","face_nose_height_incr","face_jaw_width_incr","face_chin_incr","face_cheekbones_decr","face_eye_size_